# Browser
# Jeskai Revelation: "Return target spell or permanent to its owner's hand. Jeskai Revelation deals 4 damage to any target."
# Two targets, chosen one after the other as it is cast. Each question Bot1's page asks says what that target is for - the first
# is returned, the second is dealt the damage - where both read the same bare "Target for Jeskai Revelation". Bot1 pays
# {4}{U}{R}{W} with Black Lotus (blue) and four Moxen, and returns Bot2's Ornithopter and deals the 4 damage to Bot2.

